The final metro train arrives at the destination.
I need to get near the sea.
The door of the train opens.
I step off the train.
Now I am in the metro station.
I walk towards the escalator.
I board the escalator.
The escalator goes down.
I go outside the station.
Now I am on the street level.
Here Mumbai's street is busy.
But the sea is very near.
I instantly feel the breeze.
The breeze comes from the sea.
It is humid and salty.
I like this breeze very much.
My journey by metro train is complete.
Now I walk towards the sweets shop.
